comments.text:
I am not sure I want these guys to play on that nVidia robot training ground. Is the world ready for this?

Flat foot still needs to grow "toes" in the correct configuration. The fluid gait could move into the uncanny valley and past it. And as I mentioned elsewhere, I want Daneel like Boston Dynamics needs a Positronic brain for Electric Atlas. Imagine what we might get within a year  if Boston Dynamics and all the others got together with their best ideas and went for the gold.

{^_^}
